{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/07454b143553f716c487b834532646a0.poster.avif?t=1746992140\" width=544 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/07454b143553f716c487b834532646a0.webm?t=1746992140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/07454b143553f716c487b834532646a0.mp4?t=1746992140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the World of the Abyss! </h2>A place where the darkest fears and painful memories come to life before your very eyes. Get ready to be pulled into a unique and thrilling adventure, where you'll have to team up with other brave adventurers to face your worst nightmares and overcome your deepest traumas.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/5cf4bd6ebeba6995dbd900759a2fadca.avif?t=1746992140\" width=616 height=87 /></span><br><br>In Farewell, you'll immerse yourself in a dark and mysterious world, where your cooperative skills will be put to the test at every step of the way controlling 3 different characters. Will you find the courage to face your worst fears and memories? Only you can discover that!<br><br>Are you ready to join this exciting and challenging adventure? Then get ready to explore a world full of dangers and uncover the darkest secrets of your own fears and desires. Farewell awaits you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/c6c41353456ef437229ea02e682302c3.avif?t=1746992140\" width=616 height=87 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsi